---
to: "generated/sso/federation_inventory.md"
force: true
sparql:
  bindings: |
    PREFIX essp: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/enterprise-sso-sp#>
    SELECT ?bindingId ?tenant ?protocol ?spId ?entityId ?acs ?idpId ?idpEntity ?clientId ?redirect ?pkce ?mappingId WHERE {
      ?b a essp:FederationBinding ;
          essp:bindingId ?bindingId ;
          essp:usesProtocol ?proto ;
          essp:forServiceProvider ?sp ;
          essp:trustsIdp ?idp .
      ?proto essp:protocolToken ?protocol .
      ?sp essp:spId ?spId .
      OPTIONAL { ?b essp:tenantKey ?tenant }
      OPTIONAL { ?sp essp:entityId ?entityId }
      OPTIONAL { ?sp essp:acsUrl ?acs }
      OPTIONAL { ?idp essp:idpId ?idpId }
      OPTIONAL { ?idp essp:idpEntityId ?idpEntity }
      OPTIONAL { ?b essp:clientId ?clientId }
      OPTIONAL { ?b essp:redirectUri ?redirect }
      OPTIONAL { ?b essp:pkceRequired ?pkce }
      OPTIONAL { ?b essp:claimMapping ?map . ?map essp:mappingId ?mappingId }
    } ORDER BY ?tenant ?protocol ?bindingId
---
# SJ product SSO federation inventory

Projection from `enterprise-sso-sp-pack`. Product SP / RP only — not Smalt IdP.
Facts only; no token mint, no plaintext secrets.

| binding | tenant | protocol | spId | entityId | acs / redirect | idp | clientId | pkce | claim_map |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for row in bindings -%}
| {{ row.bindingId }} | {{ row.tenant | default(value="") }} | {{ row.protocol }} | {{ row.spId }} | {{ row.entityId | default(value="") }} | {{ row.acs | default(value="") }}{% if row.redirect %} / {{ row.redirect }}{% endif %} | {{ row.idpEntity | default(value="") }} | {{ row.clientId | default(value="") }} | {{ row.pkce | default(value="") }} | {{ row.mappingId | default(value="") }} |
{% endfor %}
